    "body": "Problem:\r\nRunning tests with CMake < 3.30 fails with:\r\n```\r\n  CMake Error at xxx/cmake/RunTests.cmake:97 (file):\r\n    file must be called with at least two arguments.\r\n```\r\nXDG path is refactored in #40522 and cmake script no longer sets env\r\n`$NVIM_RPLUGIN_MANIFEST`. So, line 97 expands to `file(REMOVE_RECURSE)`,\r\nwhich only CMake >= 3.30 accepts empty path lists.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nRemove the cleanup line. It is save because the manifest is now created\r\nunder xdg_dir, which will be cleaned anyway.\r\n\r\ncc @bfredl \r\nRef: https://gitlab.kitware.com/cmake/cmake/-/merge_requests/9570",
